          "note": "Roman Urdu explanation of postfix evaluation (PDF 98-99)."
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": true,
            "items": [
              "Khali stack se shuru kar ke postfix expression baen se daen parhein.",
              "Adad: stack par push karein.",
              "Operator: zaroori operands pop kar ke amal karein aur nateeja push karein.",
              "Aakhir mein stack par bachi qeemat jawab hai."
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Misal: 3 4 5 * +. 3, 4 aur 5 push: [3, 4, 5]. * parha: 5 aur 4 pop, 4 x 5 = 20, push: [3, 20]. + parha: 20 aur 3 pop, 3 + 20 = 23, push: [23]. Jawab 23."
          },
          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "self_check",
            "prompt": "3 4 2 * + stack se nikalein.",
            "explanation": "3, 4, 2 push; * se 4 x 2 = 8, stack [3, 8]; + se 3 + 8 = 11. Jawab 11."
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Fauri khulasa"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "Postfix nikalna: adad push; operator do pop kar ke hisab kar ke push; 3 4 5 * + = 23."
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
